du|du [FILE]
reboot|reboot the system
halt|halt the system
poweroff|power off the system
chown|chown OWNER[:GROUP] FILE...
rngseed|Credit and refresh the kernel random seed
rtspcat|RTSP/RTP H.264 client, access units out as framed records
httpd|HTTP server primitive: listen, accept one request, reply
chgrp|chgrp GROUP FILE...
tr|tr
uniq|uniq
